{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國國家航空航天局（NASA）旗下的尼爾·格雷爾斯·斯威夫特天文台（Neil Gehrels Swift Observatory），在太空運行近22年後，終於結束了自己的科學探索使命。這顆原本只計劃工作兩年的太空望遠鏡，於2026年11月4日重返地球大氣層，在經歷高速再入過程中大部分結構預計已經燃燒解體，為其長達兩個多十年的宇宙觀測任務畫上句號。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585494.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.589803+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T14:18:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"fb631492d9c8effcaf76e21f1f769d9029d275452d59ebafee3a2a81c2a82e46","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}